{
 "id": "puc2-maths-04-determinants.t4.lesson",
 "chapterId": "puc2-maths-04-determinants",
 "topicId": "puc2-maths-04-determinants.t4",
 "title": {
  "en": "Adjoint and inverse of a matrix",
  "kn": "ಮಾತೃಕೆಯ ಸಹಜ ಮತ್ತು ವಿಲೋಮ"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "A formula for the inverse",
    "kn": "ವಿಲೋಮಕ್ಕೆ ಒಂದು ಸೂತ್ರ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "In the last chapter we checked inverses by multiplying. Now cofactors give us a direct formula: arrange them, transpose, and divide by the determinant.",
    "kn": "ಹಿಂದಿನ ಅಧ್ಯಾಯದಲ್ಲಿ ವಿಲೋಮವನ್ನು ಗುಣಿಸಿ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸಿದೆವು. ಈಗ ಸಹಗುಣಕಗಳು ನೇರ ಸೂತ್ರ ನೀಡುತ್ತವೆ: ಜೋಡಿಸಿ, ಪರಿವರ್ತಿಸಿ, ನಿರ್ಧಾರಕದಿಂದ ಭಾಗಿಸಿ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Find the adjoint of a matrix"
    },
    {
     "en": "Find A⁻¹ = adj A / |A|"
    },
    {
     "en": "Use |adj A| = |A|ⁿ⁻¹"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "In the last chapter we checked inverses by multiplying. Now cofactors give us a direct formula: arrange them, transpose, and divide by the determinant.",
    "kn": "ಹಿಂದಿನ ಅಧ್ಯಾಯದಲ್ಲಿ ವಿಲೋಮವನ್ನು ಗುಣಿಸಿ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸಿದೆವು. ಈಗ ಸಹಗುಣಕಗಳು ನೇರ ಸೂತ್ರ ನೀಡುತ್ತವೆ: ಜೋಡಿಸಿ, ಪರಿವರ್ತಿಸಿ, ನಿರ್ಧಾರಕದಿಂದ ಭಾಗಿಸಿ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Adjoint"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The adjoint of $A$ is the transpose of the matrix of cofactors: $\\text{adj}\\,A = [A_{ij}]'$. It satisfies $A(\\text{adj}\\,A) = (\\text{adj}\\,A)A = |A|\\,I$. For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, adj $[a\\ b;\\ c\\ d] = [d\\ -b;\\ -c\\ a]$.",
    "kn": "ಸಹಗುಣಕಗಳ ಮಾತೃಕೆಯ ಪರಿವರ್ತವೇ ಸಹಜ (adjoint). A(adj A) = (adj A)A = |A| I."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "adj A = (cofactor matrix)'"
    },
    {
     "en": "A(adj A) = |A| I"
    },
    {
     "en": "|adj A| = |A|ⁿ⁻¹ for n × n"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "The adjoint is the transpose of the cofactor matrix. A times its adjoint is the determinant of A times the identity.",
    "kn": "ಸಹಗುಣಕಗಳ ಮಾತೃಕೆಯ ಪರಿವರ್ತವೇ ಸಹಜ (adjoint). A(adj A) = (adj A)A = |A| I."
   },
   "formula": "A(\\operatorname{adj} A) = (\\operatorname{adj} A)A = |A|\\,I"
  },
  {
   "id": "wb1",
   "type": "whiteboard",
   "title": {
    "en": "Cofactors, transpose, divide"
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The adjoint is the transpose of the matrix of cofactors. For a 2 by 2: swap the diagonal and change the signs of the others."
     },
     "draw": [
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        4
       ],
       "tex": "\\operatorname{adj}A = [A_{ij}]^{T}",
       "size": 5,
       "color": "yellow"
      },
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        18
       ],
       "tex": "\\operatorname{adj}\\begin{bmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}d&-b\\\\-c&a\\end{bmatrix}",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "green"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The key identity: A times adj A equals the determinant times the identity. So divide adj A by the determinant to get the inverse."
     },
     "draw": [
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        36
       ],
       "tex": "A(\\operatorname{adj}A) = |A|\\,I",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "white"
      },
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        46
       ],
       "tex": "A^{-1} = \\tfrac{1}{|A|}\\operatorname{adj}A",
       "size": 5,
       "color": "orange"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Example: this matrix has determinant 1, so its inverse is just its adjoint."
     },
     "draw": [
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        4
       ],
       "tex": "A = \\begin{bmatrix}1&2&3\\\\0&1&4\\\\5&6&0\\end{bmatrix}",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "yellow"
      },
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        4,
        26
       ],
       "tex": "|A| = -24 + 40 - 15 = 1",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "white"
      }
     ],
     "clear": true
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Cofactors transposed give minus 24, 18, 5 in the first row; that is the inverse."
     },
     "draw": [
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        48,
        4
       ],
       "tex": "A^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix}-24&18&5\\\\20&-15&-4\\\\-5&4&1\\end{bmatrix}",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "green"
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "at": [
        48,
        30
       ],
       "text": {
        "en": "If |A| = 0: no inverse"
       },
       "size": 3,
       "color": "red"
      },
      {
       "kind": "math",
       "at": [
        48,
        40
       ],
       "tex": "|\\operatorname{adj}A| = |A|^{n-1}",
       "size": 4,
       "color": "orange"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "On the board: Cofactors, transpose, divide."
   }
  },
